</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">CRM Inbox & Multi-Channel Messaging</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A unified communication hub that brings your customer conversations from email and WhatsApp directly into 
            your CRM workflow, ensuring no message is ever overlooked.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">A Unified Conversation Layer</h2>
        <p>
            The CRM Inbox eliminates the need to switch between tabs and devices. Consolidate your corporate 
            emails and WhatsApp Business threads into a single chronological view. By presenting 
            communications as continuous "threads" rather than isolated messages, the system provides 
            your sales team with the immediate context needed to respond effectively to every 
            inbound request.
        </p>
        <p>
            Shared inbox capabilities allow teams to collaborate on specific customer threads, 
            assigning conversations to the most qualified representative while maintaining 
            internal comments and context that are invisible to the client.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">WhatsApp-First CRM Integration</h2>
        <p>
            In modern business environments, WhatsApp is often the primary channel for rapid negotiation 
            and support. Our inbox integrates natively with the WhatsApp Business API, allowing for 
            the sending of templates, media, and voice notes directly from within the CRM record. 
            All WhatsApp interactions are automatically archived to the relevant contact and 
            deal profile, ensuring that critical verbal agreements are documented.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated reply suggestions and quick-responses speed up communication for common 
            enquiries, ensuring that your team maintains the "live" response speed that 
            modern customers expect on messaging platforms.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Contextual Messaging Intelligence</h2>
        <p>
            As you message from the inbox, relevant CRM data is displayed alongside the conversation—open 
            deals, recent tickets, and organizational hierarchies. This intelligence ensures that 
            every response is informed by the latest commercial reality, preventing embarrassing 
            oversights like asking for for info already provided in a previous deal.
        </p>
        <p>
            Searchable message archives and attachment management ensure that vital information 
            buried in a thread from months ago can be retrieved in seconds, providing the 
            evidence needed for process clarity and dispute resolution.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
